{"id":"resp_8ad0a7d064a6ff17","created_at":1795618301,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"metadata":null,"model":"gpt-oss-120b","object":"response","output":[{"id":"rs_bca7ea4399b89008","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"We need to produce revised SHACL fixing errors: wrap unit and numeric constraints in sh:node shapes, and add minimum displacement >=10 kt.\n\nWe must keep rest unchanged.\n\nCurrent previous_candidate has several property shapes:\n\n- For vocab:upperIceWaterlineDisplacement property, they used sh:property with nested sh:property for unit and numeric. Need replace with sh:node containing sh:property constraints.\n\nSimilarly for vocab:waterlineCaseDisplacement inside nested case shape.\n\nAdd constraint for minInclusive 10 on numericValue.\n\nProbably need to create a sh:node that includes both unit and numeric constraints: could have two sh:property inside the node: one for unit, one for numeric with minInclusive.\n\nLet's construct.\n\nShipShape:\n\nsh:targetClass vocab:ship; (note earlier they used vocab:ship? prefix is vocab:ship; correct.)\n\nThen property for upperIceWaterlineDisplacement:\n\nsh:property [\n  sh:path vocab:upperIceWaterlineDisplacement ;\n  sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;\n  sh:class qudt:QuantityValue ;\n  sh:node [\n    sh:property [\n      sh:path qudt:unit ;\n      sh:hasValue unit:KiloTON_Metric ;\n    ] ;\n    sh:property [\n      sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n      sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n      sh:minInclusive \"10\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n    ] ;\n  ] ;\n] ;\n\nSimilarly for hasUpperIceWaterlineCase property: path vocab:hasUpperIceWaterlineCase, sh:class vocab:upperIceWaterlineCase ; and node with nested.\n\nInside node (for case) we have property waterlineCaseDisplacement with same structure.\n\nSo modify:\n\nsh:property [\n  sh:path vocab:hasUpperIceWaterlineCase ;\n  sh:class vocab:upperIceWaterlineCase ;\n  sh:node [\n    sh:property [\n      sh:path vocab:waterlineCaseDisplacement ;\n      sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;\n      sh:class qudt:QuantityValue ;\n      sh:node [\n        sh:property [\n          sh:path qudt:unit ;\n          sh:hasValue unit:KiloTON_Metric ;\n        ] ;\n        sh:property [\n          sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n          sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n          # maybe also minInclusive? Not required for case maybe same, but could apply same min. Not required by spec but okay. But keep as original (no min). We'll just replicate without min.\n        ] ;\n      ] ;\n    ] ;\n  ] ;\n] ;\n\nNeed to close correctly.\n\nAlso ensure prefixes declarations same.\n\nAdd min constraint already.\n\nAll other parts unchanged, including SPARQL.\n\nMake sure parentheses, commas correct.\n\nLet's write final SHACL.\n\n","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":null,"status":null},{"id":"msg_90df60e0c3c96514","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"<BEGIN_SHACL>\n@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .\n@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .\n@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .\n@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .\n@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .\n@prefix vocab: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#> .\n\n############################\n# Shape for Ship instances #\n############################\n\nvocab:ShipShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass vocab:ship ;\n    # ---- upperIceWaterlineDisplacement (Quantity) ----\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path vocab:upperIceWaterlineDisplacement ;\n        sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;                     # expects a QuantityValue node\n        sh:class qudt:QuantityValue ;\n        sh:node [\n            # unit must be kt\n            sh:property [\n                sh:path qudt:unit ;\n                sh:hasValue unit:KiloTON_Metric ;\n            ] ;\n            # numeric value must be decimal and at least 10 kt\n            sh:property [\n                sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n                sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n                sh:minInclusive \"10\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n            ] ;\n        ] ;\n    ] ;\n    # ---- hasUpperIceWaterlineCase relationships (with nested case validation) ----\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path vocab:hasUpperIceWaterlineCase ;\n        sh:class vocab:upperIceWaterlineCase ;\n        sh:node [\n            # ---- waterlineCaseDisplacement (Quantity) ----\n            sh:property [\n                sh:path vocab:waterlineCaseDisplacement ;\n                sh:nodeKind sh:IRI ;\n                sh:class qudt:QuantityValue ;\n                sh:node [\n                    # unit must be kt\n                    sh:property [\n                        sh:path qudt:unit ;\n                        sh:hasValue unit:KiloTON_Metric ;\n                    ] ;\n                    # numeric value must be decimal\n                    sh:property [\n                        sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n                        sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n                    ] ;\n                ] ;\n            ] ;\n        ] ;\n    ] ;\n    # ---- SPARQL constraint: ship displacement must be the maximum of its waterline cases ----\n    sh:sparql [\n        a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;\n        sh:message \"The upper‑ice‑waterline displacement (DUI) must equal the greatest displacement among the associated waterline cases.\" ;\n        sh:select \"\"\" \n            PREFIX sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#>\n            PREFIX vocab: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#>\n            PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>\n\n            SELECT $this WHERE {\n                $this vocab:upperIceWaterlineDisplacement ?shipQty .\n                ?shipQty qudt:numericValue ?shipVal .\n                $this vocab:hasUpperIceWaterlineCase ?case .\n                ?case vocab:waterlineCaseDisplacement ?caseQty .\n                ?caseQty qudt:numericValue ?caseVal .\n            }\n            GROUP BY $this ?shipVal\n            HAVING ( ?shipVal != MAX(?caseVal) )\n        \"\"\" ;\n    ] .\n\n#############################\n# Unresolved ownership note #\n#############################\n# The property vocab:upperIceWaterline is mentioned in the source but its ownership\n# cannot be resolved from the supplied ontology. No shape is generated for it,\n# preserving the ambiguity as required.\n<END_SHACL>","type":"output_text","logprobs":null}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":null}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":1.0,"background":false,"max_output_tokens":16000,"max_tool_calls":null,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt":null,"prompt_cache_options":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":null,"reasoning":null,"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"auto","status":"completed","text":null,"top_logprobs":null,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":79457,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":320,"cache_write_tokens":79136,"input_tokens_per_turn":[79457],"cached_tokens_per_turn":[320]},"output_tokens":1390,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":574,"tool_output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_per_turn":[1390],"tool_output_tokens_per_turn":[0]},"total_tokens":80847},"user":null,"presence_penalty":0.0,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"input_messages":null,"output_messages":null}